{"pages":[{"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["D E F I N I N G O U R C AU S E 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,606.80889999999999,9,false],["DEFINING",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,322.29999999999995,116.00059999999996,80,false],["OUR CAUSE",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,355.74000000000001,176.00059999999996,80,false],["A “Defining our Cause” is designed to give you",146.40000000000001,214.86349999999982,319.71300000000008,227.26549999999986,9,false],["direction as your ministry develops on your campus.",146.40000000000001,227.8594999999998,344.20200000000011,240.26149999999984,9,false],["Campus Crusade started in 1951 at UCLA by Bill",146.40000000000001,253.86049999999977,329.53200000000004,266.26249999999982,9,false],["and Vonette Bright. There are currently about 60",146.40000000000001,266.85649999999976,331.20600000000002,279.2584999999998,9,false],["ministries under the umbrella of Campus Crusade.",146.40000000000001,279.85249999999985,338.53200000000004,292.25449999999984,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,214.86349999999982,374.34000000000003,227.26549999999986,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,227.86349999999982,374.34000000000003,240.26549999999986,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,240.86349999999982,374.34000000000003,253.26549999999986,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,266.86349999999993,374.34000000000003,279.26549999999997,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,292.86349999999999,374.34000000000003,305.26549999999997,9,false],["He is our helper. (John 14:26;15:26)",388.20000000000005,214.86349999999982,521.98500000000013,227.26549999999986,9,false],["He is our teacher. (John 16:13)",388.20000000000005,227.86349999999982,502.95000000000005,240.26549999999986,9,false],["He gives us the power to share Christ with others.",388.20000000000005,240.86349999999982,575.80500000000006,253.26549999999986,9,false],["(Acts 2:8)",388.20000000000005,253.8594999999998,425.24400000000003,266.26149999999984,9,false],["The Holy Spirit does not focus on Himself, He",388.20000000000005,266.86349999999993,561.846,279.26549999999997,9,false],["glorifies Christ. (John 16:14)",388.20000000000005,279.85950000000003,496.04700000000014,292.26150000000001,9,false],["The Holy Spirit develops His character in our",388.20000000000005,292.86349999999999,560.35200000000009,305.26549999999997,9,false],["lives. (Gal. 5:22–23)",388.20000000000005,305.85949999999997,463.48500000000001,318.26149999999996,9,false],["The Campus Ministry is one of them—that’s us. Since",146.40000000000001,305.85349999999983,348.54000000000008,318.25549999999981,9,false],["the beginning, God has called Campus Crusade to help",146.40000000000001,318.84949999999981,351.55500000000012,331.25149999999979,9,false],["fulfill the Great Commission (Matt. 28:18-20) in this",146.40000000000001,331.84549999999979,344.73300000000012,344.24749999999977,9,false],["generation by winning, building and sending.",146.40000000000001,344.84149999999977,316.57200000000006,357.24349999999976,9,false],["OUR MISSION",146.40000000000001,377.24849999999998,207.13999999999999,397.7885,20,false],["Turn lost students into Christ-centered laborers.",146.40000000000001,396.86349999999999,331.66499999999996,409.26549999999997,9,false],["(Matt. 28:18–20; Matt. 9:36–38)",146.40000000000001,409.85949999999997,267.13500000000005,422.26149999999996,9,false],["2. Prayer. God longs for every person to know Him.",370.20000000000005,331.86049999999994,560.9910000000001,344.26249999999993,9,false],["He wants us to depend on Him. One of the best ways",370.20000000000005,344.85649999999993,566.85900000000015,357.25849999999991,9,false],["to demonstrate our dependence and faith is simply",370.20000000000005,357.85249999999991,562.07100000000014,370.25449999999989,9,false],["by talking with the Lord about what is on our hearts,",370.20000000000005,370.84849999999989,567.33600000000013,383.25049999999987,9,false],["minds and what we long for Him to do on the campus.",370.20000000000005,383.84449999999987,572.1690000000001,396.24649999999986,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,409.86349999999999,374.34000000000003,422.26549999999997,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,435.86349999999999,374.34000000000003,448.26549999999997,9,false],["Ask the Lord to increase your faith. (Phil 1:9–11;",388.20000000000005,409.86349999999999,568.91100000000006,422.26549999999997,9,false],["Col 1:9–12; Col. 3:16)",388.20000000000005,422.85949999999997,466.50000000000006,435.26149999999996,9,false],["Ask the Lord to open the hearts of people on",388.20000000000005,435.86349999999999,554.27700000000004,448.26549999999997,9,false],["campus to the gospel and to respond in faith to",388.20000000000005,448.85949999999997,565.39200000000017,461.26149999999996,9,false],["Jesus’ love and forgiveness. (Matt. 7:7–11)",388.20000000000005,461.85549999999995,546.61800000000017,474.25749999999994,9,false],["This is what our mission means:",146.40000000000001,435.86049999999994,268.68300000000005,448.26249999999993,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,448.86349999999999,150.54000000000002,461.26549999999997,9,false],["Taking the initiative to share our faith so that",164.40000000000001,448.86349999999999,335.75100000000009,461.26549999999997,9,false],["every student on every campus can hear the",164.40000000000001,461.85949999999997,329.6400000000001,474.26149999999996,9,false],["gospel in an attractive, meaningful manner.",164.40000000000001,474.85549999999995,328.47000000000008,487.25749999999994,9,false],["(Win) Col. 1:28, Rom 10:13–14.",164.40000000000001,487.85149999999993,280.58100000000002,500.25349999999992,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,500.86349999999999,150.54000000000002,513.26549999999997,9,false],["Offering a place where Christian students can",164.40000000000001,500.86349999999999,337.89300000000014,513.26549999999997,9,false],["connect with other Christians and grow in their",164.40000000000001,513.85950000000003,345.17400000000009,526.26149999999996,9,false],["faith. (Build) Eph 2:10; 2 Tim 2:2.",164.40000000000001,526.85549999999989,289.60800000000006,539.25749999999994,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,539.86349999999993,150.54000000000002,552.26549999999997,9,false],["Equipping students to walk with God for a",164.40000000000001,539.86349999999993,323.82600000000014,552.26549999999997,9,false],["lifetime and have an impact for Christ on the",164.40000000000001,552.85950000000003,333.68100000000004,565.26150000000007,9,false],["campus and the world. (Send) 2 Cor. 5:14–15; Rev.",164.40000000000001,565.85550000000001,351.51900000000001,578.25750000000005,9,false],["5:9; Rom 12:1–2; Matt. 24:14.",164.40000000000001,578.85149999999999,272.44500000000005,591.25350000000003,9,false],["OUR SOURCE",146.40000000000001,611.24850000000004,204.24000000000001,631.7885,20,false],["We know that apart from Christ we can do nothing.",146.40000000000001,630.86349999999993,339.65700000000015,643.26549999999997,9,false],["So all the above is fruitless if we do not depend on the",146.40000000000001,643.85950000000003,347.46000000000015,656.26150000000007,9,false],["Lord to work in and through us.",146.40000000000001,656.85550000000001,265.10100000000006,669.25750000000005,9,false],["Remember, even if only a few of you are praying",370.20000000000005,487.85649999999993,549.91200000000026,500.25849999999991,9,false],["together, Jesus is there with you (Matt. 18:20)",370.20000000000005,500.85249999999991,543.35100000000011,513.25449999999989,9,false],["OUR SCOPE",370.20000000000005,533.24849999999992,421.30000000000007,553.7885,20,false],["Every student. We want to link arms with Christian",370.20000000000005,552.86349999999993,565.24800000000016,565.26549999999997,9,false],["students, volunteers and churches to help give every",370.20000000000005,565.85950000000003,567.55200000000013,578.26150000000007,9,false],["student an opportunity to say “Yes!” to Christ and",370.20000000000005,578.85550000000001,557.47200000000021,591.25750000000005,9,false],["experience God’s love and forgiveness. We look for",370.20000000000005,591.85149999999999,560.72100000000012,604.25350000000003,9,false],["every available means to share Christ in a relevant",370.20000000000005,604.84750000000008,560.29800000000023,617.24950000000001,9,false],["and compassionate manner.",370.20000000000005,617.84350000000006,476.68800000000005,630.24549999999999,9,false],["1. The Holy Spirit is the One who glorifies Christ.",146.40000000000001,682.85649999999998,331.49400000000009,695.25850000000003,9,false],["When we placed our trust in Christ as Savior and",146.40000000000001,695.85249999999996,331.72800000000007,708.25450000000001,9,false],["Lord, Christ enters the lives of believers by His Holy",146.40000000000001,708.84850000000006,343.51800000000014,721.25049999999999,9,false],["Spirit. Jesus said many things about Him:",146.40000000000001,721.84450000000004,304.01700000000005,734.24649999999997,9,false],["Every person on earth. Campus Crusade for Christ is",370.20000000000005,643.84450000000004,569.72100000000012,656.24650000000008,9,false],["committed to unite with the worldwide body of Christ",370.20000000000005,656.84050000000002,574.41000000000008,669.24250000000006,9,false],["to help accelerate world evangelization through",370.20000000000005,669.8365,550.47000000000014,682.23850000000004,9,false],["ongoing training, discipleship and prayer. We want to",370.20000000000005,682.83249999999998,571.51200000000017,695.23450000000003,9,false],["influence a chain reaction of people reaching people",370.20000000000005,695.82850000000008,567.1110000000001,708.23050000000001,9,false],["with the Good News of Christ’s love and forgiveness.",370.20000000000005,708.82450000000006,568.30800000000022,721.22649999999999,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]]}]}